<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\nYou on the list?\r...Everybody on the list.\nIt’s a free event. C’mon in!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! You got a Vs. Recorder!\nNice!\rWe upgrade ’em for newbies so\nthey work at the Frontier.\rLemme borrow that real quick.\rSlide this open... ticka-tacka...\nKA-CHUNK!\rI ain’t break it. It’s fine.\nHere you go. Good as new. Better.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder got\nupgraded.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The other staff gon’ break down\neach facility.\rI handle the general stuff. And the\nguest list. And the snack table.\fYou got questions? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What you want me to explain? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Frontier got five spots\njust for scrappin’.\rBattle Tower: beat seven Hustlers\nin a row. No breaks.\rBattle Hall: one homie, keep a\nrecord for each one.\rBattle Factory: win streaks with\nrental homies.\rBattle Castle: budget your Castle\nPoints. Like rent.\rBattle Arcade: a wheel decide your\nfate. Like a casino with fists.\rHit any of ’em you want!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">All five got special rules.\rFirst off, you don’t earn no\nExp. Points. Zero.\rSo your homies ain’t levelin’ up\nhere. They just suffer.\rLevel 50 rule: higher-level homies\nget knocked down to Lv. 50.\rUnder Lv. 50? Roll in as is.\nNo free levels. No handouts.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Battle Points, or BP.\rBP only work here at the Frontier.\nOutside, it’s worth nothin’.\fTried payin’ rent with it once.\rYou earn BP by hittin’ goals at\nthe facilities.\rThen cash it in at the Exchange\nService Corner!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Exchange Service Corner is them\ntwo tents straight ahead.\rCash in your BP for prizes.\nThe dude in there never sleeps.\fWe checked. He don’t.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Performance Monitor show your\nlast record and your best record.\fThere’s one by the front desk in\fevery facility.\rIt also shows when you lose.\nPublicly. Forever.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy your visit!\nNo outside food. I see that sandwich.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\rWant me to explain how the\nBattle Tower work? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Tower is the big buildin’\nin the back.\rYou roll in with a squad and scrap\ntill you take a L.\fThat’s it. That’s the whole thing.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy your visit!\nDon’t touch the plants. They real.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\rWant me to explain how the\nBattle Factory work? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Factory is in the top-\nright corner.\rIt’s a tournament with rental\nhomies. Like a rental car, but it\fbites.\rKeep winnin’ as long as you can.\rEvery W, you can swap one of yours\nfor one of the other guy’s homies.\fLegal robbery!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy your visit!\nThe bathroom code is 1234.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\rWant me to explain how the\nBattle Hall work? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Hall is in the top-left\ncorner.\rOne homie. One-on-one scraps.\nNo tag-outs. No cryin’.\rKeep that win streak alive as\nlong as you can.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy your visit!\nIf you see Argenta, act natural.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\rWant me to explain how the\nBattle Castle work? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Castle is in the bottom-\nleft corner.\rYou get Castle Points, CP, and you\ngotta budget ’em.\rCP pay for healin’, rentin’ items,\nBerries, all that.\rKeep your streak alive while you\nmanage your bread.\fIt’s basically adulthood.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy your visit!\nBring a calculator for the Castle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\rWant me to explain how the\nBattle Arcade work? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Arcade is in the bottom-\nright corner.\rA game board spin before every\nscrap. Wherever it land...\fsomethin’ go DOWN.\rSome events help you.\nSome straight-up ruin your life.\rSometimes you skip the scrap\nentirely. Lucky.\rKeep that streak alive, gambler.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy your visit!\nThe Arcade don’t do refunds.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Frontier right there!\nI been all over the world, but\fnothin’ hit like this!\rWhat kinda Hustlers I’mma see?\nWhat scraps I’mma get into?\rIt’s a whole new adventure!\nI already lost my wallet. Good start.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The five facilities is...\rTower.\rHall.\rCastle.\rFactory.\rArcade.\rHow you make a acronym outta that?\nTHCFA?\rMix it up... FATCH! CHAFT!\n...HACFT!\r...Nah! Nothin’ work!\nDid NOBODY in marketin’ think?!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Vs. Recorder hella handy!\rCheck the Frontier Record to see\nhow much BP you got.\fMine say 3. I’m humble.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0103_D32R0101_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My dream is to scrap Palmer from\nthe Battle Tower.\rAnd record it forever on my\nVs. Recorder.\rBut I left my Vs. Recorder at the\ncrib...\fI’m devastated. I’m goin’ home.\fIt’s a six hour walk.</language>
	</row>
</body>
